                "h": 125,
                "wSize": "fill",
                "hSize": "hug",
                "text": "Six of the eight games play both on your own and in a room, and every game has rooms, so “solo” and “multiplayer” would put most games in both groups. How you can play stays a fact on every card (“Solo or 2–8 players”), and Play solo is its first button.",
