                "h": 125,
                "wSize": "fill",
                "hSize": "hug",
                "text": "Kind says what you will be doing, and every game has exactly one: Puzzles have one answer to find, Spot & remember is sharp eyes and memory, Party is drawing, bluffing and reading the room. New games join one of them, or a fourth kind once three games share it.",
